{"jurisdiction": "Lincoln, NE", "record_kind": "operative_provision", "section_id": "6288", "section_number": "1.04.020", "heading": "1.04.020 Title of Office.", "citation": "1.04.020 Title of Office.", "path": ["Lincoln Municipal Code", "Title 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS", "Chapter 1.04 GENERAL PROVISIONS"], "toc_path_best_effort": ["Lincoln Municipal Code", "Title 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS", "Chapter 1.04 GENERAL PROVISIONS"], "full_text": "Use of the title of any officer, employee, department, board, or commission shall mean that officer, employee, department, board, or commission of the City of Lincoln. (Ord. 15335 §2; November 6, 1989).", "body_html": "<section class=\"secLvl4 _001 _001-002 _001-002-001 _001-002-001-002\" data-secid=\"6288\" id=\"secid-6288\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<p> Use of the title of any officer, employee, department, board, or commission shall mean that officer, employee, department, board, or commission of the City of Lincoln.  (Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=15335\">15335</a> §2; November 6, 1989).</p><p></p>\n\n</section>", "source_html": "<section class=\"secLvl4 _001 _001-002 _001-002-001 _001-002-001-002\" data-secid=\"6288\" id=\"secid-6288\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<h4>1.04.020 Title of Office.  </h4><p> Use of the title of any officer, employee, department, board, or commission shall mean that officer, employee, department, board, or commission of the City of Lincoln.  (Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=15335\">15335</a> §2; November 6, 1989).</p><p></p>\n<p class=\"archiveNotice nullValue\"></p>\n</section>", "html_serialization": "BeautifulSoup html.parser; retained original response bytes are authoritative", "tables": [], "links": [{"text": "15335", "attributes": {"href": "https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&docnum=15335"}, "resolved_href": "https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&docnum=15335", "target_section_id": null}], "list_count": 0, "effective_date_notices": [], "omitted_placeholder_metadata": [{"text": "", "classes": ["archiveNotice", "nullValue"], "reason": "publisher nullValue/sentinel metadata; not an authoritative effective date"}], "source_url": "https://online.encodeplus.com/regs/lincoln-ne/doc-view.aspx?secid=6288&ajax=0", "raw_sha256": "4f2a53917856379e9a1fc41fe856d4e5d2d5962eae69fd5529687e9f5baa7686", "complete_corpus": false}
{"jurisdiction": "Lincoln, NE", "record_kind": "operative_provision", "section_id": "6289", "section_number": "1.04.030", "heading": "1.04.030 Interpretation of Language.", "citation": "1.04.030 Interpretation of Language.", "path": ["Lincoln Municipal Code", "Title 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS", "Chapter 1.04 GENERAL PROVISIONS"], "toc_path_best_effort": ["Lincoln Municipal Code", "Title 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS", "Chapter 1.04 GENERAL PROVISIONS"], "full_text": "All words and phrases shall be construed according to the common and approved usage of the language, but technical words and phrases and such others as may have acquired a peculiar and appropriate meaning in the law shall be construed and understood according to such peculiar and appropriate meaning. (Ord. 15335 §3; November 6, 1989).", "body_html": "<section class=\"secLvl4 _001 _001-002 _001-002-001 _001-002-001-003\" data-secid=\"6289\" id=\"secid-6289\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<p> All words and phrases shall be construed according to the common and approved usage of the language, but technical words and phrases and such others as <a class=\"iLink\" href=\"doc-view.aspx?pn=0&amp;ajax=0&amp;secid=6272\" target=\"_blank\">may</a> have acquired a peculiar and appropriate meaning in the <a class=\"iLink\" href=\"doc-view.aspx?pn=0&amp;ajax=0&amp;secid=6271\" target=\"_blank\">law</a> shall be construed and understood according to such peculiar and appropriate meaning.  (Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=15335\">15335</a> §3; November 6, 1989).</p>\n\n</section>", "source_html": "<section class=\"secLvl4 _001 _001-002 _001-002-001 _001-002-001-003\" data-secid=\"6289\" id=\"secid-6289\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<h4>1.04.030 Interpretation of Language.  </h4><p> All words and phrases shall be construed according to the common and approved usage of the language, but technical words and phrases and such others as <a class=\"iLink\" href=\"doc-view.aspx?pn=0&amp;ajax=0&amp;secid=6272\" target=\"_blank\">may</a> have acquired a peculiar and appropriate meaning in the <a class=\"iLink\" href=\"doc-view.aspx?pn=0&amp;ajax=0&amp;secid=6271\" target=\"_blank\">law</a> shall be construed and understood according to such peculiar and appropriate meaning.  (Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=15335\">15335</a> §3; November 6, 1989).</p>\n<p class=\"archiveNotice nullValue\"></p>\n</section>", "html_serialization": "BeautifulSoup html.parser; retained original response bytes are authoritative", "tables": [], "links": [{"text": "may", "attributes": {"class": ["iLink"], "href": "doc-view.aspx?pn=0&ajax=0&secid=6272", "target": "_blank"}, "resolved_href": "https://online.encodeplus.com/regs/lincoln-ne/doc-view.aspx?pn=0&ajax=0&secid=6272", "target_section_id": "6272"}, {"text": "law", "attributes": {"class": ["iLink"], "href": "doc-view.aspx?pn=0&ajax=0&secid=6271", "target": "_blank"}, "resolved_href": "https://online.encodeplus.com/regs/lincoln-ne/doc-view.aspx?pn=0&ajax=0&secid=6271", "target_section_id": "6271"}, {"text": "15335", "attributes": {"href": "https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&docnum=15335"}, "resolved_href": "https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&docnum=15335", "target_section_id": null}], "list_count": 0, "effective_date_notices": [], "omitted_placeholder_metadata": [{"text": "", "classes": ["archiveNotice", "nullValue"], "reason": "publisher nullValue/sentinel metadata; not an authoritative effective date"}], "source_url": "https://online.encodeplus.com/regs/lincoln-ne/doc-view.aspx?secid=6289&ajax=0", "raw_sha256": "9a46dbb65f64d91e93e8690704c5a22013831c34a8db1908e8de18785122c8d3", "complete_corpus": false}
{"jurisdiction": "Lincoln, NE", "record_kind": "operative_provision", "section_id": "12858", "section_number": "20.12.140", "heading": "20.12.140 Table No. R301.2 Amended; Climatic and Geographic Design Criteria.", "citation": "20.12.140 Table No. R301.2 Amended; Climatic and Geographic Design Criteria.", "path": ["Lincoln Municipal Code", "Title 20 BUILDING CODE", "Chapter 20.12 LINCOLN RESIDENTIAL BUILDING CODE"], "toc_path_best_effort": ["Title 20 BUILDING CODE", "Chapter 20.12 LINCOLN RESIDENTIAL BUILDING CODE"], "full_text": "Table No. R301.2 of the International Residential Code is amended to read as follows:\n\nTABLE R301.2\n\nCLIMATIC AND GEOGRAPHIC DESIGN CRITERIA\n\nGROUND SNOW LOAD\nWIND SPEED d\n\n(mph)\nSEISMIC DESIGN CATEGORY f\nSUBJECT TO DAMAGE FROM\nWINTER DESIGN TEMP e\nICE BARRIER UNDERLAYMENT REQUIRED h\nFLOOD HAZARDS g\n\nWeathering a\nFrost Line depth b\nTermite c\n\n25 psf\n115 mph\nB\nSevere\n36\"\nmoderate to heavy\n70° F\nYes\nSee LMC 27.52 & 27.53\n\nAll footnotes to Table R301.2 of this code shall apply.\n\n(Ord. 21820 §5; December 15, 2025; Ord. 20937 §27; June 29, 2020).", "body_html": "<section class=\"secLvl4 _001 _001-021 _001-021-004 _001-021-004-027\" data-secid=\"12858\" id=\"secid-12858\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n\n<p>Table No. R301.2 of the International Residential Code is amended to read as follows:</p>\n<table class=\"general\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"heading\">\n<th colspan=\"9\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><strong>TABLE R301.2</strong><br/>\n<strong>CLIMATIC AND GEOGRAPHIC DESIGN CRITERIA</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"sheading\">\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 9.9%;\">GROUND SNOW LOAD</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 8.6%;\">WIND SPEED<sup>d</sup><br/>\r\n\t\t\t(mph)</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 13.1%;\">SEISMIC DESIGN CATEGORY<sup>f</sup></th>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"width: 27.7%;\">SUBJECT TO DAMAGE FROM</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 8.6%;\">WINTER DESIGN TEMP<sup>e</sup></th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 18.1%;\">ICE BARRIER UNDERLAYMENT REQUIRED<sup>h</sup></th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 14%;\">FLOOD HAZARDS<sup>g</sup></th>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"subsubheading\">\n<th style=\"width: 11.1%; text-align: center;\">Weathering<sup>a</sup></th>\n<th style=\"width: 8%; text-align: center;\">Frost Line depth<sup>b</sup></th>\n<th style=\"width: 8.6%; text-align: center;\">Termite<sup>c</sup></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"alt1\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">25 psf</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">115 mph</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">B</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Severe</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">36\"</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">moderate to heavy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">70° F</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Yes</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">See LMC <a class=\"xref\" href=\"doc-viewer.aspx#secid-11820\" target=\"_blank\">27.52</a> &amp; <a class=\"xref\" href=\"doc-viewer.aspx#secid-11871\" target=\"_blank\">27.53</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>All footnotes to Table R301.2 of this code shall apply. </p>\n<p>(<span data-ordfnote=\"1\">Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=21820\" target=\"_blank\">21820</a> §5; December  15, 2025; Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=20937\" target=\"_blank\">20937</a> §27; June  29, 2020</span>).</p>\n<p class=\"archiveNotice\"></p>\n</section>", "source_html": "<section class=\"secLvl4 _001 _001-021 _001-021-004 _001-021-004-027\" data-secid=\"12858\" id=\"secid-12858\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<h4>20.12.140 Table No. R301.2 Amended; Climatic and Geographic Design Criteria.</h4>\n<p>Table No. R301.2 of the International Residential Code is amended to read as follows:</p>\n<table class=\"general\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"heading\">\n<th colspan=\"9\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><strong>TABLE R301.2</strong><br/>\n<strong>CLIMATIC AND GEOGRAPHIC DESIGN CRITERIA</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"sheading\">\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 9.9%;\">GROUND SNOW LOAD</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 8.6%;\">WIND SPEED<sup>d</sup><br/>\r\n\t\t\t(mph)</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 13.1%;\">SEISMIC DESIGN CATEGORY<sup>f</sup></th>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"width: 27.7%;\">SUBJECT TO DAMAGE FROM</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 8.6%;\">WINTER DESIGN TEMP<sup>e</sup></th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 18.1%;\">ICE BARRIER UNDERLAYMENT REQUIRED<sup>h</sup></th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 14%;\">FLOOD HAZARDS<sup>g</sup></th>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"subsubheading\">\n<th style=\"width: 11.1%; text-align: center;\">Weathering<sup>a</sup></th>\n<th style=\"width: 8%; text-align: center;\">Frost Line depth<sup>b</sup></th>\n<th style=\"width: 8.6%; text-align: center;\">Termite<sup>c</sup></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"alt1\">\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">25 psf</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">115 mph</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">B</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Severe</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">36\"</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">moderate to heavy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">70° F</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Yes</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">See LMC <a class=\"xref\" href=\"doc-viewer.aspx#secid-11820\" target=\"_blank\">27.52</a> &amp; <a class=\"xref\" href=\"doc-viewer.aspx#secid-11871\" target=\"_blank\">27.53</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>All footnotes to Table R301.2 of this code shall apply. </p>\n<p>(<span data-ordfnote=\"1\">Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=21820\" target=\"_blank\">21820</a> §5; December  15, 2025; Ord. <a href=\"https://lincoln.ne.gov/aspx/city/clerk/docman.aspx?cmd=file&amp;docnum=20937\" target=\"_blank\">20937</a> §27; June  29, 2020</span>).</p>\n<p class=\"archiveNotice\"></p>\n</section>", "html_serialization": "BeautifulSoup html.parser; retained original response bytes are authoritative", "tables": [[[{"text": "TABLE R301.2 CLIMATIC AND GEOGRAPHIC DESIGN CRITERIA", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "1", "colspan": "9", "html": "<th colspan=\"9\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><strong>TABLE R301.2</strong><br/>\n<strong>CLIMATIC AND GEOGRAPHIC DESIGN CRITERIA</strong></th>"}], [{"text": "GROUND SNOW LOAD", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "2", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 9.9%;\">GROUND SNOW LOAD</th>"}, {"text": "WIND SPEED d (mph)", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "2", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 8.6%;\">WIND SPEED<sup>d</sup><br/>\r\n\t\t\t(mph)</th>"}, {"text": "SEISMIC DESIGN CATEGORY f", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "2", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 13.1%;\">SEISMIC DESIGN CATEGORY<sup>f</sup></th>"}, {"text": "SUBJECT TO DAMAGE FROM", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "1", "colspan": "3", "html": "<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"width: 27.7%;\">SUBJECT TO DAMAGE FROM</th>"}, {"text": "WINTER DESIGN TEMP e", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "2", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 8.6%;\">WINTER DESIGN TEMP<sup>e</sup></th>"}, {"text": "ICE BARRIER UNDERLAYMENT REQUIRED h", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "2", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 18.1%;\">ICE BARRIER UNDERLAYMENT REQUIRED<sup>h</sup></th>"}, {"text": "FLOOD HAZARDS g", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "2", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 14%;\">FLOOD HAZARDS<sup>g</sup></th>"}], [{"text": "Weathering a", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "1", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th style=\"width: 11.1%; text-align: center;\">Weathering<sup>a</sup></th>"}, {"text": "Frost Line depth b", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "1", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th style=\"width: 8%; text-align: center;\">Frost Line depth<sup>b</sup></th>"}, {"text": "Termite c", "tag": "th", "rowspan": "1", "colspan": "1", "html": "<th style=\"width: 8.6%; text-align: center;\">Ter